Mods: {
	魔刀千刃: {
		Items: {
			MoDaoQianRen: {
				DisplayName: Thousand Demon Daggers
				Tooltip: Its blade is broken, but a thousand edges still whisper within.
				Stage0: Stage 0 - Dormant Blade
				Stage1: Stage I - Awakened Blade
				Stage2: Stage II - Thousand Blades
				Stage3: Stage III - Unbound Blades
				Stage4: Stage IV - Orb of Blades
				Stage5: Stage V - Blade Field
				Stage6: Stage VI - Moonbreaker Blades
				Stage7: Stage VII - Thousandfold Convergence
				Stats: Current stats: Damage {0} / Max blade {1} / Current speed frames {2}
				Mechanic0: A growing main weapon from spawn. Left-click chains two heavy slashes that build Shard Charge; right click spends it on short-range shards. Right click it in your inventory after your first boss to awaken it.
				Mechanic1: Left-click upgrades into a three-hit chain. With a complete blade, the third hit becomes a charged empowered slash; once extended into fragments, it becomes a 360-degree sweep.
				Mechanic2: Maximum blade length increases further. The right-click shard stream fully forms with higher release density as a reliable damage option.
				Mechanic3: Max blade length, Shard Charge capacity, and shard stream density increase. Later stages add light guidance to the stream.
				Mechanic4: Hold middle mouse to control a shard orb. The orb and its tethered shard field deal melee damage.
				Mechanic5: The middle-mouse orb turns spent Shard Charge into burst power. Bursts are for damage windows; left click and the right-click shard stream remain the sustained core.
				Mechanic6: Post-Golem Moon Lord preparation. Damage, blade length, Shard Charge capacity, orb radius, automatic bursts, and burst ceiling increase further.
				Mechanic7: Post-Moon Lord final form. Left-click hits shed homing shards; detached shard hits restore Shard Charge. Right click forms a high-pressure shard stream, and full middle-mouse bursts trigger a brief convergence state.
				ModeControlsLocked: Mode switch: Numpad 1 selects blade form.\\nNumpad 2 unlocks at Stage IV; Numpad 3/5 unlock at Stage V.\\nKeys can be changed in Controls under mod keybinds.
				ModeControlsShardUnlocked: Mode switch: Numpad 1 blade form / Numpad 2 shard summon.\\nNumpad 3/5 unlock at Stage V.\\nKeys can be changed in Controls under mod keybinds.
				ModeControlsUnlocked: Mode switch: 1 blade / 2 shard summon / 3 reforged greatsword.\\n4 guard support / 5 Crimson Rift.\\nKeys can be changed in Controls under mod keybinds.
				Mode2Locked: Shard summon mode unlocks at Stage IV - Orb of Blades.
				Mode3Locked: Reforged greatsword mode unlocks at Stage V - Blade Field.
				Mode4Locked: Guard support mode unlocks at Stage IV - Orb of Blades.
				Mode5Locked: Crimson Rift mode unlocks at Stage V - Blade Field.
				ModeGameplay1: Current playstyle: Blade form.\\nLeft click builds Shard Charge; right click fires shard streams.\\nStage IV adds the middle-mouse orb.
				ModeGameplay2: Current playstyle: Shard summon.\\nSummoned shards track enemies; middle mouse swaps to shears.\\nRight click sustains the shears typhoon.
				ModeGameplay2Locked: Current playstyle: Shard summon unlocks at Stage IV.\\nFocused on tracking damage and shears typhoon pressure.
				ModeGameplay3: Current playstyle: Reforged greatsword.\\nLeft click uses slow triple heavy slashes; right click dashes into ring slashes.\\nMiddle mouse spends Shard Charge on a burst.
				ModeGameplay3Locked: Current playstyle: Reforged greatsword unlocks at Stage V.\\nFocused on slow heavy hits, dashes, and charged bursts.
				ModeGameplay4: Current playstyle: Guard support.\\nLeft, middle, and right click swap guard strength.\\nTrade damage and summon capacity for damage reduction.
				ModeGameplay4Locked: Current playstyle: Guard support unlocks at Stage IV.\\nFocused on damage reduction, guard fields, and reduced summon capacity.
				ModeGameplay5: Current playstyle: Crimson Rift.\\nRight click raises the blade; hold left click to release the wide slash.\\nHits trigger heavy feedback.
				ModeGameplay5Locked: Current playstyle: Crimson Rift unlocks at Stage V.\\nRight click readies the blade; left click releases a wide slash.
				Mode3BurstNeedCharge: Mode 3 middle burst needs Shard Charge.
				PrefixDamageBonus: +{0}% damage
				PrefixDamagePenalty: -{0}% damage
				PrefixSpeedBonus: +{0}% speed
				PrefixSpeedPenalty: -{0}% speed
				PrefixCritBonus: +{0}% critical strike chance
				PrefixCritPenalty: -{0}% critical strike chance
				PrefixKnockbackBonus: +{0}% knockback
				PrefixKnockbackPenalty: -{0}% knockback
				Ready: Ready
				Missing: Missing
				Next1: Next awakening ({0}): defeat any boss, then spend 3 Fallen Stars and 4 Lens.
				Next2: Next awakening ({0}): defeat Skeletron or Queen Bee, then spend 30 Bones or 12 Bee Wax, plus 10 Demonite or Crimtane Bars.
				Next3: Next awakening ({0}): enter Hardmode, then spend 15 Hellstone Bars, 12 Crystal Shards, and 8 Souls of Light or Night.
				Next4: Next awakening ({0}): defeat any mechanical boss, then spend 12 Hallowed Bars and 8 Souls of Might, Sight, or Fright.
				Next5: Next awakening ({0}): defeat Plantera, then spend 18 Chlorophyte Bars, 10 Ectoplasm, 1 Life Fruit, and 25 Shadow Scales or Tissue Samples.
				Next6: Next awakening ({0}): defeat Golem, then spend 12 Beetle Husks, 1 Solar Tablet, and 12 Ectoplasm.
				Next7: Final awakening ({0}): defeat Moon Lord, then spend 12 Luminite Bars and 8 of each Lunar Fragment.
				NeedFirstBoss: The blade is still silent. Defeat any boss first.
				NeedStage1Items: Awakening requires 3 Fallen Stars and 4 Lens.
				NeedSkeletronOrQueenBee: The blade needs stronger prey. Defeat Skeletron or Queen Bee first.
				NeedStage2Items: Awakening requires 30 Bones or 12 Bee Wax, plus 10 Demonite or Crimtane Bars.
				NeedHardmode: The blade needs Hardmode power. Defeat the Wall of Flesh first.
				NeedStage3Items: Unbinding requires 15 Hellstone Bars, 12 Crystal Shards, and 8 Souls of Light or Night.
				NeedMechBoss: The shard orb needs mechanical power. Defeat any mechanical boss first.
				NeedStage4Items: Orb awakening requires 12 Hallowed Bars and 8 Souls of Might, Sight, or Fright.
				NeedPlantera: The blade field needs power from the deep jungle. Defeat Plantera first.
				NeedStage5Items: Blade Field awakening requires 18 Chlorophyte Bars, 10 Ectoplasm, 1 Life Fruit, and 25 Shadow Scales or Tissue Samples.
				NeedGolem: Moonbreaker awakening needs power from the jungle temple. Defeat Golem first.
				NeedStage6Items: Moonbreaker awakening requires 12 Beetle Husks, 1 Solar Tablet, and 12 Ectoplasm.
				NeedMoonLord: Thousandfold Convergence needs Moon Lord's echo. Defeat Moon Lord first.
				NeedStage7Items: Final awakening requires 12 Luminite Bars and 8 Solar, Vortex, Nebula, and Stardust Fragments.
				Upgrade1: Thousand Demon Daggers awakened. The broken blade answers your swing.
				Upgrade2: A thousand edges answer your call. Shard Charge unlocked.
				Upgrade3: Thousand Demon Daggers unbound. Longer reach and a denser shard stream awakened.
				Upgrade4: The thousand shards form an orb. Hold middle mouse to control it.
				Upgrade5: Blade Field awakened. The orb now feeds on Shard Charge and bursts apart when released.
				Upgrade6: Moonbreaker awakened. The shards now chase down fleeing prey until the moonlight splits.
				Upgrade7: Thousandfold Convergence awakened. Every shard now answers the same swing.
				AwakenedCombatText: Blade Awakened
				FixedStage: Fixed-stage test item. It cannot be upgraded by right-clicking.
				CurrentLimit: This version has reached its current growth limit.
			}

