			StageEditor: {
				Title: Blade Stage Tuning
				Subtitle: Click the slot to read the blade from cursor, hand, or inventory, then edit raw base stats
				Hint: Hover or select a parameter to see its effect, saved range, and practical floor; Save applies only to this stage.
				EmptySlot: Click the left slot to read your owned Thousand Demon Daggers
				SlotHint: Click to read weapon
