				ModeGuideTitle: Current stage playstyle
				ModeGuide1: Mode 1: left-click melee chains build Shard Charge, right click spends it on shard streams, and middle mouse controls the orb after Stage IV.
				ModeGuide2: Mode 2: press Numpad 2 to summon tracking shards; middle mouse swaps to shears, and right click sustains the shears typhoon.
				ModeGuide2Locked: Mode 2: unlocks at Stage IV as shard summon mode, focused on tracking summons and shears typhoon pressure.
				ModeGuide3: Mode 3: press Numpad 3 for slow triple greatsword slashes; right click dashes into ring slashes, and middle mouse charges a burst.
				ModeGuide3Locked: Mode 3: unlocks at Stage V as reforged greatsword, focused on slow heavy slashes, dashes, and charged bursts.
				ModeGuide4: Mode 4: press Numpad 4, then left/middle/right click to swap guard strength and trade output for damage reduction.
				ModeGuide4Locked: Mode 4: unlocks at Stage IV as guard support, focused on damage reduction, guard fields, and compressed summon capacity.
				ModeGuide5: Mode 5: press Numpad 5, right click to raise the blade, then hold left click to release Crimson Rift; hits trigger heavy feedback.
				ModeGuide5Locked: Mode 5: unlocks at Stage V as Crimson Rift, readying with right click and releasing a wide slash with left click.
