		UpdateNotice: {
			Header: Thousand Demon Daggers v0.4 updated: the blade is now built as a full-run main weapon.
			Line1: Left click reworked: clearer swings, an empowered slash with the complete blade, and a spin finisher with the extended shard blade.
			Line2: Right click and middle mouse were rebalanced so shard streams, the shard orb, and final-stage resource loops all matter.
			Line3: Shard visuals, melee attack speed scaling, WeaponOut texture sizing, and the release icon were also polished.
		}
	}
}
